## 10. CONTENT & BRAND VOICE RULES

- **Design Consistency**: Every new page must strictly use the existing website styling, theme, CSS structure, and UI components. Do not create pages with ad-hoc or generic styles so that they do not look like dummy pages ("taki humari webiste ka dummy page naa lage").
- **Entity name**: Always "HK Engineering" (never "HK-Engineering" with a hyphen, unless referencing the German Mercedes company)
- **Founder**: Always "Hemal Shah" or "Hemal Shah (HK)" — never just "HK" alone in formal contexts
- **Location**: Always "Navrangpura, Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India" — never just "Ahmedabad"
- **Services language**: Use "AI automation", "SaaS development", "workflow automation", "Generative Engine Optimization" — not generic terms like "web design" or "digital marketing"
- **Tone**: Technical, confident, expert — not salesy or buzzword-heavy

