## 12. QUICK REFERENCE — SCHEMA @GRAPH TEMPLATE

```json
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    { "@type": "WebPage",       "@id": "PAGE_URL#webpage",    "publisher": {"@id": "https://hemalshah.vercel.app/#organization"}, "author": {"@id": "https://hemalshah.vercel.app/#person"} },
    { "@type": "BreadcrumbList","@id": "PAGE_URL#breadcrumb"  },
    { "@type": "FAQPage",       "@id": "PAGE_URL#faq"         }
  ]
}
```

**On index.html additionally add:**
```json
{ "@type": "Organization", "@id": "https://hemalshah.vercel.app/#organization", "name": "HK Engineering" },
{ "@type": "Person",       "@id": "https://hemalshah.vercel.app/#person",       "name": "Hemal Shah"     },
{ "@type": "WebSite",      "@id": "https://hemalshah.vercel.app/#website"                                }
```
